{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117335","id":3385992744,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7J0iYo","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117335","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117335.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117335.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117335","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117335/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117335/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117335/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/2df02c8463f9b57467c5e7b1443c09169548a0ef","number":117335,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix macOS Steam time tracking lost when opening a project","user":{"login":"Arthurmtro","id":55857849,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1ODU3ODQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55857849?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arthurmtro","html_url":"https://github.com/Arthurmtro","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arthurmtro/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arthurmtro/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arthurmtro/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arthurmtro/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arthurmtro/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arthurmtro/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arthurmtro/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arthurmtro/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arthurmtro/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes #112281.\n\nOn macOS, when the Project Manager opens a project, it spawns the Editor via `NSWorkspace`. The `NSWorkspaceOpenConfiguration` object doesn't carry over the parent's environment by default — it gets a clean one from `launchd`. This causes `SteamAppId` (set by the Steam client) to be missing in the Editor process, so `SteamAPI_Init()` silently fails and Steam shows \"no longer running.\"\n\nThis passes the parent process environment through to the spawned app instance, matching the behavior on Windows (`CreateProcessW` inherits by default) and Linux (`fork`/`execvp` inherits by default). Both the modern `NSWorkspaceOpenConfiguration` path and the legacy `launchApplicationAtURL:` path (x86_64 pre-10.15) are fixed.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097780,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc3ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:macos","name":"platform:macos","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098255,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyNTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:platforms","name":"topic:platforms","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","number":24,"state":"closed","title":"4.7","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","follo